# A chat with a subagent at work: the running strip above the composer names it, says what it
# is doing and what it has cost, on a wide window. Another chat's triggers make the project
# listen, which the line under the composer says.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
prefer themeId aura-noir
prefer paneImage null
project storefront shop
chat Rook
title "Nightly chores"
trigger "Daily docs pass" 86400
trigger "Daily phone port" 86400
chat Wren
title "Cart total bug"
say "delegate 600000"
settle 4
front Wren
settle 2
snap running-strip
move 650,855
settle 1.5
snap running-strip-listening
